\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Countries with MDD-W estimates from more than one platform in the SDG 2.2.4 series (panel countries only). Among the 11 pairs measured no more than two years apart, the GDQP estimate is higher in 10; the three pairs separated by four or more years (Uzbekistan, Sierra Leone, Mongolia) confound platform differences with real dietary change and are included for completeness only.}}{11}{table.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dual}{{1}{11}{Countries with MDD-W estimates from more than one platform in the SDG 2.2.4 series (panel countries only). Among the 11 pairs measured no more than two years apart, the GDQP estimate is higher in 10; the three pairs separated by four or more years (Uzbekistan, Sierra Leone, Mongolia) confound platform differences with real dietary change and are included for completeness only}{table.caption.4}{}}
